							<p>Located on the east side of campus on the ground floor of the Language and Dining Center. LDC offers an all-you-care-to-eat dining experience with a wide variety of options including options from home-style comfort foods to an exclusively vegan station along with our SimplyOASIS station that provides full meal options that exclude the top-9 allergens and gluten.</p>
