<div class="c-card g-col g-col-style--white">

	
	
	<div class="c-card__content">

		
		
		
					
<div class="c-card__desc" >
	
<div class="t-content wysiwyg__content" >
	<p>Bon Appétit at Carleton College is fighting food waste and hunger by recovering surplus perishable food from our campus that would otherwise go to waste.</p>
<p>This surplus perishable food is donated to people in need at 10 different community partners including Greenvale Park Community School.</p>
<p>Learn more about the <a href="http://www.foodrecoverynetwork.org/">Food Recovery Network</a> and <a href="http://www.bamco.com/timeline/focusing-food-recovery-2/">Bon Appétit’s food recovery efforts.</a></p>

</div>

</div>

		
		
	</div>
