	<div class="c-card__content">

		
		
		
					
<div class="c-card__desc" >
	
<div class="t-content wysiwyg__content" >
	<p>Meal plans may only be used by the student whose name is on the OneCard; they are not transferable. There are no reimbursements for remaining balances at any time.</p>
<p><strong>20 Meal Plan</strong><br />
&#8211; 3 meals per day Monday-Saturday and 2 meals on Sunday<br />
&#8211; $75 in dining dollars</p>
<p><strong>15 Meal Plan</strong><br />
